@startuml
skinparam handwritten false
skinparam monochrome true
title UC15: Manage Promotional Vouchers - Activity Diagram
start
:Administrator opens Voucher Management console;
:Select action (Create new voucher or Edit existing campaign);
if (Action?) then (Create New)
  :Enter voucher code, discount rate/amount, and usage quota;
  :Set effective date range (startDate to endDate);
  :Define minimum order value requirement;
else (Edit Existing)
  :Search and select voucher campaign;
  :Modify quota limits or toggle active status;
endif
:System validates campaign business rules;
if (Rules valid?) then (yes)
  :Save voucher record to database;
  :Log administrative audit trail;
  :Display success confirmation;
else (no)
  :Highlight invalid fields with error message;
endif
stop
@enduml
